        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 8px;">True 24/7 Answering</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A person picks up at 2 a.m. on a Sunday, not a voicemail. Emergency calls go straight to the on-call tech.</p>
