      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 8px;">Upfront Pricing</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You get a firm number before work starts. Emergency diagnostics run $150-$250 and we credit it toward the repair.</p>
